  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Kevin Lobo, Chairman and CEO of Stryker, has been named Executive of the Year by MedTech Dive, a leading industry news publisher. The 2019 Dive Awards recognize the industry’s top disruptors and innovators. Mr. Lobo was selected by the editors of MedTech Dive based on thorough and independent research, reporting, and analysis. Notably, this is the second accolade Mr. Lobo has received this year celebrating his vision and leadership. The first was by Forbes as one of <a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/about/news/2019/forbes-ranks-kevin-lobo-as-one-of-america-s-most-innovative-lead.html\">America’s Most Innovative Leaders</a> earlier this fall.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.medtechdive.com/news/executive-kevin-lobo-stryker-dive-awards/566001/\">Read more</a> about the 2019 Executive of the Year Award from MedTech Dive.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Dec 09 2019 20:45:13 GMT+0000",
